{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"events.economist.com/Registration and light breakfast.txt"},"lines":{"text":"Before moving to the UK I was Senior Vice President of Transformation and Global Marketing E.ON SE, focussing on how we steer and grow businesses, reshaping the brand and customer experience. It was in this role that I developed a mindset for commercial performance and how to be more transformative – repositioning companies with a growth mindset and the power of a strong brand. I'm proud to co-lead E.ON Next as Chief Commercial Officer and build on the momentum we already have in our business. On top of this, I also retain responsibility across E.ON SE for Global Marketing and Communications. I've recently relocated to the UK with my wife and three children.\n"},"line_number":557,"absolute_offset":35556,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"co-lead"},"start":396,"end":403}]}}
